{"slug": "practice-dsa-longest-common-prefix", "title": "Longest Common Prefix", "source_url": "https://takeuforward.org/practice/dsa/longest-common-prefix", "extracted_by": "live-ssr", "length": 5684, "code_blocks": 0, "images": 0, "html": "<div class=\"flex h-full min-h-0 w-full flex-col\"><div class=\"flex h-full min-h-0 w-full flex-col\"><div class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__wrapper\"><div class=\"scroll-fade-module__DRol_a__shell ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__scrollContainer\"><div class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__scrollable\" data-tufy-selectable=\"\"><header class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__header\"><h1 class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__title\">79. Longest Common Prefix<span class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__titlePotdBadge\"></span></h1><div class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__metaRow\"><div class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__shortcutButtons\"></div></div></header><div class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__content\"><div class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__richText\"><p>Write a function to find the <strong>longest</strong> <strong>common</strong> <strong>prefix</strong> string amongst an array of strings.</p><p>If there is no common prefix, return an empty string \"\".</p></div><section class=\"mt-6\"><h3 class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__sectionTitle\">Example 1:</h3><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1rem_1fr] gap-1\"><div aria-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"shrink-0 my-auto mx-auto bg-(--color-brand-primary-bg-3)\" role=\"separator\" style=\"width:1px;height:100%\"></div><div class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__richText\"><p><strong>Input :</strong> str = [\"flowers\" , \"flow\" , \"fly\", \"flight\" ]</p><p><strong>Output :</strong> \"fl\"</p><p><strong>Explanation :</strong> </p><p>All strings given in array contains common prefix \"fl\".</p></div></div></section><section class=\"mt-6\"><h3 class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__sectionTitle\">Example 2:</h3><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1rem_1fr] gap-1\"><div aria-orientation=\"vertical